          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "Bassem Naim, a member of Hamas's political bureau, urged mediators and the US to pressure Netanyahu to adhere to the agreed roadmap.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "Channel News Asia",
          "url": "https://www.channelnewsasia.com/world/israel-netanyahu-rejects-us-gaza-plan-hamas-trump-6308466",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "Israeli operations in Gaza have killed 1,258 Palestinians since the October ceasefire, according to the Gaza health ministry.",
          "kind": "figure",
